    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41247" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτανύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτείνω</span>
			, <i>stretch,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				14
			</span></i> ; <i>spread over,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς ἐπὶ νύκτ᾽ ὀλοὴν
					τάνυσε..ὑσμίνῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.567
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>stretch tight,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτοι πόλλ᾽ ἐπὶ τόξα
			τανύσσεται</span> (fut.
			
				Med.
			 in pass. sense) <i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				3
			</span></i> ; <i>push home</i> [a bolt], 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ δὲ κληῖδ᾽ ἐτάνυσσεν ἱμάντι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					1.442
				</span></i>
			.</div>
